## 1. Grant and scope

Subject to the terms of CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 and the additional terms below, you are
granted a royalty-free, non-exclusive, non-transferable right to **use** and
**share verbatim copies** of this Software for **non-commercial** purposes,
including the operation of the Software in your own local environment.

## 2. Attribution — Mandatory and Unmodified

2.1. You must give **appropriate credit** to the Author, provide a link to this
license, and indicate if changes were made. You may do so in any reasonable
manner, but not in any way that suggests the Author endorses you or your use.

2.2. **Non-Removable Donation Badge.** Every user-facing interface of the
Software (Windows Host Gateway, Web client, Android client, and any other
surface) **must** permanently and visibly display the Author's donation badge
with the Author's current donation credentials.

2.3. **Integrity enforcement.** The Software ships with integrity checks
(checksum / hash verification) over the user-interface components that render
the donation badge. The Software will refuse to start and will display an
integrity error if those components are modified, hidden, or removed. You must
not circumvent, disable, or re-key these integrity checks.

## 3. Exclusive source of donation credentials

3.1. The **sole legitimate source** of the Author's donation credentials is the
Author's configuration (`config/donation.json` in this repository, or a
subsequent configuration channel designated by the Author).

3.2. Replacing, hiding, or substituting the Author's donation contacts in any
third-party fork, release, build, or copy is **strictly prohibited**.

3.3. When the Author updates the donation credentials, every third-party
builder and distributor is obliged to reflect those updated credentials in
their distributions.

## 4. Penalty clause

4.1. Any natural or legal person who distributes a modified, unofficial, or
third-party build of this Software in which the Author's original donation
credentials are missing, altered, or not current **shall pay a License penalty
fee of USD $5,900 (five thousand nine hundred US dollars) per calendar month**
of publication, distribution, or provision of access to such a copy.

4.2. The penalty accrues for each full or partial calendar month during which
such a non-compliant copy is published, distributed, or made available.

## 5. No warranties

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,
FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE
AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER
LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,
OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE
SOFTWARE.

